WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.192
Today we will notice how art can carry cultural meaning. Our work connects with

00:00:05.192 --> 00:00:07.688
international artists and communities around the world.

00:00:08.533 --> 00:00:11.712
Look at a cloth pattern and point to its repeated marks.

00:00:12.533 --> 00:00:15.499
Sketch two repeated shapes from the cloth onto paper.

00:00:16.533 --> 00:00:22.003
Add one personal variation and explain what it represents. Justify a revision using

00:00:22.003 --> 00:00:24.107
evidence from another world tradition.
